{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_25","type":"agent_message","text":"The core implementation is in place: the browser generates a print-ready PNG for the current timestamp, Scalable Press creates the design before payment, Stripe Checkout collects shipping, and a signed webhook converts the paid session into a Scalable Press quote/order. I’ve already verified both provider calls independently: a real test design was created and a real Stripe test Checkout Session was returned."}}
