{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_45","type":"mcp_tool_call","server":"toolshed_web_search","tool":"call_web_search","arguments":{"fast_mode":false,"web_search_instructions":"Find the current Scalable Press API v2 quote endpoint documentation, including exact request fields for DTG products, product IDs and size values, address schema, and any sandbox/test-mode requirements. Also check whether next-level-boyfriend-tee and next-level-fitted-crew are current valid IDs. Return concise cited findings with URLs."},"result":null,"error":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_45","type":"mcp_tool_call","server":"toolshed_web_search","tool":"call_web_search","arguments":{"fast_mode":false,"web_search_instructions":"Find the current Scalable Press API v2 quote endpoint documentation, including exact request fields for DTG products, product IDs and size values, address schema, and any sandbox/test-mode requirements. Also check whether next-level-boyfriend-tee and next-level-fitted-crew are current valid IDs. Return concise cited findings with URLs."},"result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Research Report: Scalable Press API v2 Quote Endpoint Documentation\n\n## Executive Summary\n\nThe Scalable Press API v2 provides a comprehensive suite of endpoints for managing print-on-demand services, including obtaining quotes for Direct-to-Garment (DTG) products. The API documentation details the required request fields, product IDs, size values, address schema, and sandbox/testing requirements. However, specific product IDs such as `next-level-boyfriend-tee` and `next-level-fitted-crew` are not explicitly listed in the available sources.\n\n## Key Findings\n\n- **Finding 1:** The Scalable Press API v2 includes a `POST /v2/quote` endpoint that allows users to request price quotes for products, printing, and shipping costs. ([apis.io](https://apis.io/providers/scalablepress/?utm_source=openai))\n\n- **Finding 2:** To obtain detailed item information, including size values and product IDs, the API provides a `GET /v2/products/{productId}/items` endpoint, which returns data such as quantity, price, weight, size, color, and Global Trade Item Number (GTIN). ([scalablepress.com](https://scalablepress.com/docs/?utm_source=openai))\n\n- **Finding 3:** The API requires HTTP Basic authentication, where the API key is supplied as the password, and the username is left blank. ([apis.apievangelist.com](https://apis.apievangelist.com/store/scalablepress-product-api/?utm_source=openai))\n\n- **Finding 4:** The documentation does not specify sandbox or test-mode requirements, nor does it confirm the validity of product IDs `next-level-boyfriend-tee` and `next-level-fitted-crew`.\n\n---\n\n## Detailed Source Analysis\n\n### Source 1: API Documentation\n\n- **URL:** [https://scalablepress.com/docs/](https://scalablepress.com/docs/)\n\n- **Domain:** scalablepress.com\n\n- **Publication Date:** Date not specified\n\n- **Source Type:** Commercial\n\n- **Credibility:** High (Official API documentation)\n\n**Summary:**\n\nThe Scalable Press API documentation provides detailed information on various endpoints, including those for listing product availability and detailed item information. The `GET /v2/products/{productId}/items` endpoint returns comprehensive data for each product, such as quantity, price, weight, size, color, and GTIN. The documentation also outlines the structure of the item object and its attributes.\n\n**Key Data Points:**\n\n- Endpoint: `GET /v2/products/{productId}/items`\n\n- Attributes: quantity, price, weight, size, color, GTIN\n\n- Authentication: API key required\n\n**Notable Quotes:**\n\n> \"Specify a product id to receive product information. For each color of the product, this information includes the following: Quantity, Price, Weight, Size, Color, Global Trade Item Number.\"\n\n---\n\n### Source 2: Scalable Press API Overview\n\n- **URL:** [https://scalablepress.com/api](https://scalablepress.com/api)\n\n- **Domain:** scalablepress.com\n\n- **Publication Date:** Date not specified\n\n- **Source Type:** Commercial\n\n- **Credibility:** High (Official API overview)\n\n**Summary:**\n\nThis source provides an overview of the Scalable Press API, highlighting its capabilities for programmatically sending customized products. It emphasizes features such as no minimum order quantities, fast turnaround times, and multiple production centers. The API supports various product types, including t-shirts, mugs, phone cases, and posters.\n\n**Key Data Points:**\n\n- No minimum order quantities\n\n- Typical shipping within 1-3 business days\n\n- Production centers in CA, IN, and PA\n\n**Notable Quotes:**\n\n> \"We believe ordering customized products should be as simple and inexpensive as ordering normal products. This starts with our API.\"\n\n---\n\n### Source 3: Scalable Press — API Provider, Schemas | APIs.io Providers\n\n- **URL:** [https://apis.io/providers/scalablepress/](https://apis.io/providers/scalablepress/)\n\n- **Domain:** apis.io\n\n- **Publication Date:** Last month\n\n- **Source Type:** Other\n\n- **Credibility:** Medium (Aggregated API information)\n\n**Summary:**\n\nThis source lists various endpoints available in the Scalable Press API, including those for listing product categories, retrieving product information, and obtaining quotes. It specifies the `POST /v2/quote` endpoint for requesting price quotes and details the authentication method as HTTP Basic, requiring the API key as the password.\n\n**Key Data Points:**\n\n- Endpoint: `POST /v2/quote`\n\n- Authentication: HTTP Basic (API key as password)\n\n- API Version: 2.0\n\n**Notable Quotes:**\n\n> \"By default, every request must be authenticated.\"\n\n---\n\n## Cross-Reference Analysis\n\n**Consensus Across Sources:**\n\n- The Scalable Press API v2 provides endpoints for obtaining product information and quotes. ([scalablepress.com](https://scalablepress.com/docs/?utm_source=openai))\n\n- Authentication is required for API access, typically using an API key. ([scalablepress.com](https://scalablepress.com/docs/?utm_source=openai))\n\n**Conflicting Information:**\n\n- No conflicting information was identified among the sources.\n\n**Information Gaps:**\n\n- The documentation does not specify sandbox or test-mode requirements.\n\n- The validity of product IDs `next-level-boyfriend-tee` and `next-level-fitted-crew` is not confirmed.\n\n---\n\n## Research Metadata\n\n- **Search Completed:** 2026-08-23T20:57:39Z\n\n- **Sources Analyzed:** 3 sources\n\n- **Total Content Reviewed:** Approximately 1,200 words\n\n- **Search Confidence:** Medium (Due to lack of information on sandbox requirements and specific product IDs)\n\n--- "}],"_meta":{"openai/widgetSessionId":"123dc8a6-ad49-4f1d-8fd6-b8e77ed9491b"},"structured_content":null},"error":null,"status":"completed"}}
