{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_47","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"curl -fsSL https://scalablepress.com/docs/ | rg -io '.{0,100}(quote|orderToken|address1|designId).{0,220}' | head -40\"","aggregated_output":"<p>The Scalable Press API is a comprehensive REST service for viewing the product catalog, making quotes, and completing orders for our printing and fulfillment services.</p>\n<blockquote>\n</blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n</blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n</blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n</blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n</blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n</blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n</blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n</blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n</blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n</blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n</blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n</blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n</blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n</blockquote>\n          <h1 id=\"quote-api\">Quote API</h1>\n<p>The Quote API lets you get an exact quote before placing an order. When using this API, it is important to understand the three possible outcomes:</p>\n<li><a href=\"#order-ready-scenario\">Order-ready</a> &mdash; quote is successful and the information sent to the API is enough to place an actual order</li>\n<li><a href=\"#quote-only-scenario\">Quote-only</a> &mdash; quote is successful but the information sent is not sufficient to place an order</li>\n<li><a href=\"#error-scenario\">Error</a> &mdash; quote is unsuccessful due to the information being sent to the API is either invalid or incomplete</li>\n<p><a href=\"#standard-quote\">Standard quotes</a> allow a single design printed on one or more products, shipped to a single address. <a href=\"#bulk-quote\">Bulk quotes</a> allow greater flexibility for multiple printing orders and split shipping.</p>\n<p>Besides making a quote, the Quote API can also be used to <a href=\"#retrieve-quote\">retrieve a quote</a> which was previously completed. The quote API can also <a href=\"#breakdown\">breakdown</a> a bulk quote&rsquo;s pricing into a per item basis.</p>\n<p>In order to receive a quote and place an order for any of these advanced features, the <a href=\"#bulk-quote\">bulk quote API</a> should be used:</p>\n<p>A bulk quote with a <a href=\"#single-design\">single but unspecified design</a> can be generated to estimate post-discount pricing.</p>\n<p>The Quote API also allows for <a href=\"#custom-order-features\">custom order features</a> for your order:</p>\n<blockquote>\ncurl: (23) Failure writing output to destination, passed 16384 returned 0\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_48","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"curl -fsSL https://scalablepress.com/docs/ -o /tmp/scalablepress-docs.html; rg -n -i 'standard-quote|orderToken|designId|address1|zip|products' /tmp/scalablepress-docs.html | head -80\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_48","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"curl -fsSL https://scalablepress.com/docs/ -o /tmp/scalablepress-docs.html; rg -n -i 'standard-quote|orderToken|designId|address1|zip|products' /tmp/scalablepress-docs.html | head -80\"","aggregated_output":"216:<p>The Products API provides specifications and pictures of all products available for printing.</p>\n220:<li><a href=\"#list-products\">List products (in a category)</a></li>\n301:<h2 id=\"list-products\">List products</h2>\n318:  </span><span class=\"nl\">\"products\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"w\">\n323:        </span><span class=\"nl\">\"url\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"http://www.ooshirts.com/products/5/catalog.jpg\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n327:      </span><span class=\"nl\">\"url\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"{{base}}{{print.products.base}}/gildan-sweatshirt-crew\"</span><span class=\"w\">\n333:        </span><span class=\"nl\">\"url\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"http://www.ooshirts.com/products/6/catalog.jpg\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n337:      </span><span class=\"nl\">\"url\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"{{base}}{{print.products.base}}/gildan-heavy-sweatshirt\"</span><span class=\"w\">\n345:<p>Specify a category id to receive category information and a list of products in that category.</p>\n407:<div class=\"highlight\"><pre class=\"highlight plaintext\"><code>GET {{base}}{{print.products.base}}/{productId}\n412:<div class=\"highlight\"><pre class=\"highlight shell\"><code>curl <span class=\"s2\">\"{{base}}{{print.products.base}}/gildan-sweatshirt-crew\"</span>\n496:      </span><span class=\"nl\">\"url\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"http://i1.ooshirts.com/products/5/front.jpg\"</span><span class=\"w\">\n500:      </span><span class=\"nl\">\"url\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"http://i1.ooshirts.com/products/5/back.jpg\"</span><span class=\"w\">\n504:      </span><span class=\"nl\">\"url\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"http://i1.ooshirts.com/products/5/collar.jpg\"</span><span class=\"w\">\n509:    </span><span class=\"nl\">\"url\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"http://www.ooshirts.com/products/5/catalog.jpg\"</span><span class=\"w\">\n512:  </span><span class=\"nl\">\"url\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"{{base}}{{print.products.base}}/gildan-sweatshirt-crew\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n513:  </span><span class=\"nl\">\"availabilityUrl\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"{{base}}{{print.products.base}}/gildan-sweatshirt-crew/availability\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n657:<div class=\"highlight\"><pre class=\"highlight plaintext\"><code>GET {{base}}{{print.products.base}}/{productId}/availability\n662:<div class=\"highlight\"><pre class=\"highlight shell\"><code>curl <span class=\"s2\">\"{{base}}{{print.products.base}}/gildan-sweatshirt-crew/availability\"</span>\n738:<div class=\"highlight\"><pre class=\"highlight plaintext\"><code>GET {{base}}{{print.products.base}}/{productId}/items\n739:</code></pre></div><div class=\"highlight\"><pre class=\"highlight shell\"><code>curl <span class=\"s2\">\"{{base}}{{print.products.base}}/gildan-sweatshirt-crew/items\"</span>\n854:<p><a href=\"#standard-quote\">Standard quotes</a> allow a single design printed on one or more products, shipped to a single address. <a href=\"#bulk-quote\">Bulk quotes</a> allow greater flexibility for multiple printing orders and split shipping.</p>\n863:<li>Multiple printing — print on different products and take advantage of possible combined shipping</li>\n892:  <span class=\"nt\">-d</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"products[0][id]=gildan-sweatshirt-crew\"</span> <span class=\"se\">\\</span>\n893:  <span class=\"nt\">-d</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"products[0][color]=ash\"</span> <span class=\"se\">\\</span>\n894:  <span class=\"nt\">-d</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"products[0][quantity]=12\"</span> <span class=\"se\">\\</span>\n895:  <span class=\"nt\">-d</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"products[0][size]=lrg\"</span> <span class=\"se\">\\</span>\n897:  <span class=\"nt\">-d</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"address[address1]=123 Scalable Drive\"</span> <span class=\"se\">\\</span>\n900:  <span class=\"nt\">-d</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"address[zip]=12345\"</span> <span class=\"se\">\\</span>\n901:  <span class=\"nt\">-d</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"designId=53ed3a23b3730f0e27a66513\"</span>\n912:  </span><span class=\"nl\">\"orderToken\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"c6ae6ca449719e5237d103139255ecdd\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n935:  <span class=\"nt\">-d</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"products[0][id]=gildan-sweatshirt-crew\"</span> <span class=\"se\">\\</span>\n936:  <span class=\"nt\">-d</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"products[0][color]=ash\"</span> <span class=\"se\">\\</span>\n937:  <span class=\"nt\">-d</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"products[0][quantity]=12\"</span> <span class=\"se\">\\</span>\n938:  <span class=\"nt\">-d</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"products[0][size]=lrg\"</span>\n949:  </span><span class=\"nl\">\"orderToken\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kc\">null</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n953:      </span><span class=\"nl\">\"path\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"designId\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n954:      </span><span class=\"nl\">\"message\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"No 'designId' provided\"</span><span class=\"w\">\n965:<p>This scenario occurs when the information sent to the API is enough to create a quote but not enough to create an order-ready quote (hence the orderToken field is null).</p>\n984:  <span class=\"nt\">-d</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"products[0][id]=gildan-sweatshirt-crew\"</span> <span class=\"se\">\\</span>\n985:  <span class=\"nt\">-d</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"products[0][color]=ash\"</span> <span class=\"se\">\\</span>\n986:  <span class=\"nt\">-d</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"products[0][quantity]=12\"</span> <span class=\"se\">\\</span>\n987:  <span class=\"nt\">-d</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"products[0][size]=xsml\"</span>\n997:        </span><span class=\"nl\">\"path\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"products[0]\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n1004:      </span><span class=\"nl\">\"path\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"designId\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n1005:      </span><span class=\"nl\">\"message\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"No 'designId' provided\"</span><span class=\"w\">\n1021:<h2 id=\"standard-quote\">Standard quote</h2>\n1033:  <span class=\"nt\">-d</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"products[0][id]=gildan-sweatshirt-crew\"</span> <span class=\"se\">\\</span>\n1034:  <span class=\"nt\">-d</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"products[0][color]=ash\"</span> <span class=\"se\">\\</span>\n1035:  <span class=\"nt\">-d</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"products[0][quantity]=12\"</span> <span class=\"se\">\\</span>\n1036:  <span class=\"nt\">-d</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"products[0][size]=lrg\"</span> <span class=\"se\">\\</span>\n1038:  <span class=\"nt\">-d</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"address[address1]=123 Scalable Drive\"</span> <span class=\"se\">\\</span>\n1041:  <span class=\"nt\">-d</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"address[zip]=12345\"</span> <span class=\"se\">\\</span>\n1042:  <span class=\"nt\">-d</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"designId=53ed3a23b3730f0e27a66513\"</span>\n1053:  </span><span class=\"nl\">\"orderToken\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"c6ae6ca449719e5237d103139255ecdd\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n1058:<p>The standard quote API allows a quote for a single design printed on one or more products, shipped to a single address.</p>\n1077:<td><code class=\"prettyprint\">designId</code></td>\n1085:<td>Providing this optional <a href=\"#sides-object\">sides object</a> instead of a <code class=\"prettyprint\">designId</code> allows making quotes without creating a <a href=\"#design-api\">Design</a> first</td>\n1089:<td><code class=\"prettyprint\">products</code></td>\n1192:<td><code class=\"prettyprint\">address1</code></td>\n1212:<td><code class=\"prettyprint\">zip</code></td>\n1214:<td>Zip code or postal code of customer</td>\n1278:<td><code class=\"prettyprint\">orderToken</code></td>\n1324:  <span class=\"nt\">-d</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"items[0][designId]=53ed3a23b3730f0e27a66513\"</span> <span class=\"se\">\\</span>\n1325:  <span class=\"nt\">-d</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"items[0][products][0][id]=gildan-sweatshirt-crew\"</span> <span class=\"se\">\\</span>\n1326:  <span class=\"nt\">-d</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"items[0][products][0][color]=ash\"</span> <span class=\"se\">\\</span>\n1327:  <span class=\"nt\">-d</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"items[0][products][0][quantity]=12\"</span> <span class=\"se\">\\</span>\n1328:  <span class=\"nt\">-d</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"items[0][products][0][size]=med\"</span> <span class=\"se\">\\</span>\n1330:  <span class=\"nt\">-d</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"items[1][designId]=53ed3a23b3730f0e27a66513\"</span> <span class=\"se\">\\</span>\n1331:  <span class=\"nt\">-d</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"items[1][products][0][id]=gildan-sweatshirt-crew\"</span> <span class=\"se\">\\</span>\n1332:  <span class=\"nt\">-d</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"items[1][products][0][color]=ash\"</span> <span class=\"se\">\\</span>\n1333:  <span class=\"nt\">-d</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"items[1][products][0][quantity]=12\"</span> <span class=\"se\">\\</span>\n1334:  <span class=\"nt\">-d</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"items[1][products][0][size]=lrg\"</span>\n1345:  </span><span class=\"nl\">\"orderToken\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kc\">null</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n1394:  <span class=\"nt\">-d</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"items[0][products][0][id]=gildan-sweatshirt-crew\"</span> <span class=\"se\">\\</span>\n1395:  <span class=\"nt\">-d</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"items[0][products][0][color]=ash\"</span> <span class=\"se\">\\</span>\n1396:  <span class=\"nt\">-d</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"items[0][products][0][quantity]=12\"</span> <span class=\"se\">\\</span>\n1397:  <span class=\"nt\">-d</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"items[0][products][0][size]=med\"</span> <span class=\"se\">\\</span>\n1400:  <span class=\"nt\">-d</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"items[1][products][0][id]=gildan-sweatshirt-crew\"</span> <span class=\"se\">\\</span>\n1401:  <span class=\"nt\">-d</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"items[1][products][0][color]=ash\"</span> <span class=\"se\">\\</span>\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_49","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"sed -n '1021,1060p' /tmp/scalablepress-docs.html; sed -n '1068,1222p' /tmp/scalablepress-docs.html | sed -E 's/<[\"'^>]+>/ /g'\"' | sed -E 's/&mdash;/-/g;s/&rsquo;/'\\\"'\\\"'/g;s/&quot;/\\\"/g' | tr -s ' ' | head -180\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_49","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"sed -n '1021,1060p' /tmp/scalablepress-docs.html; sed -n '1068,1222p' /tmp/scalablepress-docs.html | sed -E 's/<[\"'^>]+>/ /g'\"' | sed -E 's/&mdash;/-/g;s/&rsquo;/'\\\"'\\\"'/g;s/&quot;/\\\"/g' | tr -s ' ' | head -180\"","aggregated_output":"<h2 id=\"standard-quote\">Standard quote</h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p>DEFINITION</p>\n</blockquote>\n<div class=\"highlight\"><pre class=\"highlight plaintext\"><code>POST {{base}}{{print.quote.base}}\n</code></pre></div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>EXAMPLE REQUEST</p>\n</blockquote>\n<div class=\"highlight\"><pre class=\"highlight shell\"><code>curl <span class=\"s2\">\"{{base}}{{print.quote.base}}\"</span> <span class=\"se\">\\</span>\n  <span class=\"nt\">-u</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"{{username}}:{{apiKey}}\"</span> <span class=\"se\">\\</span>\n  <span class=\"nt\">-d</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"type=dtg\"</span> <span class=\"se\">\\</span>\n  <span class=\"nt\">-d</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"products[0][id]=gildan-sweatshirt-crew\"</span> <span class=\"se\">\\</span>\n  <span class=\"nt\">-d</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"products[0][color]=ash\"</span> <span class=\"se\">\\</span>\n  <span class=\"nt\">-d</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"products[0][quantity]=12\"</span> <span class=\"se\">\\</span>\n  <span class=\"nt\">-d</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"products[0][size]=lrg\"</span> <span class=\"se\">\\</span>\n  <span class=\"nt\">-d</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"address[name]=My Customer\"</span> <span class=\"se\">\\</span>\n  <span class=\"nt\">-d</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"address[address1]=123 Scalable Drive\"</span> <span class=\"se\">\\</span>\n  <span class=\"nt\">-d</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"address[city]=West Pressfield\"</span> <span class=\"se\">\\</span>\n  <span class=\"nt\">-d</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"address[state]=CA\"</span> <span class=\"se\">\\</span>\n  <span class=\"nt\">-d</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"address[zip]=12345\"</span> <span class=\"se\">\\</span>\n  <span class=\"nt\">-d</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"designId=53ed3a23b3730f0e27a66513\"</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>EXAMPLE RESPONSE</p>\n</blockquote>\n<div class=\"highlight\"><pre class=\"highlight json\"><code><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"w\">\n  </span><span class=\"nl\">\"total\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">224.17</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n  </span><span class=\"nl\">\"subtotal\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">191.99</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n  </span><span class=\"nl\">\"tax\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">20.38</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n  </span><span class=\"nl\">\"fees\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n  </span><span class=\"nl\">\"shipping\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">10.80</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n  </span><span class=\"nl\">\"orderToken\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"c6ae6ca449719e5237d103139255ecdd\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n  </span><span class=\"nl\">\"warnings\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">],</span><span class=\"w\">\n  </span><span class=\"nl\">\"mode\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"test\"</span><span class=\"w\">\n</span><span class=\"p\">}</span><span class=\"w\">\n</span></code></pre></div>\n<p>The standard quote API allows a quote for a single design printed on one or more products, shipped to a single address.</p>\n<h3 id=\"arguments\">Arguments</h3>\n<p><a href=\"#quote-object\">Quote object</a></p>\n \n \n \n type \n string \n Type of product this design is for: screenprint , dtg , case , mug , or poster \n Always \n \n \n designId \n string \n Unique identifier for a design object to print, provided by the Design API \n Order&#8209;ready \n \n \n sides \n object \n Providing this optional sides object instead of a designId allows making quotes without creating a Design first \n Quote&#8209;only \n \n \n products \n array \n Array of order product objects to print on \n Always \n \n \n address \n object \n Shipping address object \n Order&#8209;ready \n \n \n features \n object \n Custom features object \n \n \n \n name \n string \n Optional reference name \n \n \n \n Sides Object \n \n \n Attribute \n Type \n Description \n \n \n \n front \n number \n DTG : set to any positive number to indicate printing on this side, Screenprint : the number of colors used on this side \n \n \n back \n number \n Same as front \n \n \n right \n number \n Same as front \n \n \n left \n number \n Same as front \n \n \n\n At least one side is required when providing a sides object for a quote. \n Order Product Object \n \n \n Attribute \n Type \n Description \n \n \n \n id \n string \n productId of the product you wish to order, retrieved from the Product API , this product must be compatible with the design provided \n \n \n color \n string \n Color of the product, see the Product API for available colors \n \n \n size \n string \n Size of the product, see the Product API for available sizes \n \n \n quantity \n number \n Quantity of this product/color/size to order \n \n \n Address Object \n \n \n Attribute \n Type \n Description \n \n \n \n name \n string \n Name of customer receiving the product \n \n \n company \n string \n Optional company associated with the customer \n \n \n address1 \n string \n Address line 1 of customer \n \n \n address2 \n string \n Optional address line 2 of customer \n \n \n city \n string \n City of customer \n \n \n state \n string \n State or province where customer resides \n \n \n zip \n number \n Zip code or postal code of customer \n \n \n country \n string \n ISO3166 country code , defaults to US \n \n \n email \n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
